+   `security find-generic-password`. At night the keychain is locked, so that","+   call fails, and with `set -e` the script exits before `curl` runs. It never","+   read `~/.config/nightly-review/config.toml`, the file that exists for exactly","+   this case. (Testing it by hand works because you pass `TG_BOT_TOKEN` in the","+   environment and your keychain is unlocked.)","+","+## Fixes made","+","+- `bin/nightly-review.zsh`: use `rc=$?` instead of `status`. Run `claude` with","+  `< /dev/null` and write its stderr to `$OUT.err`. Treat a non-zero exit *or*","+  an empty output file as a failure, and put the start of the error in the","+  failure message.","+- `bin/notify.sh`: try the keychain first. If that fails, read","+  `telegram_bot_token` from `config.toml`. If there is still no token, print a","+  clear error to stderr and exit.","+- `com.vk.nightly-review.plist`: add `USER=vk` to `EnvironmentVariables` and add","+  `~/.local/bin` to `PATH`, which is where the native `claude` installer puts the","+  binary.","+- `config.toml`: set to `chmod 600` because it holds a bot token.","+","+Checks run: `zsh -n`, `bash -n` and `plutil -lint` pass. With stubbed `claude`,","+`security` and `curl`, the failure path now sends","+\"nightly review FAILED (exit 1): Not logged in\". `notify.sh` falls back to the","+config token when the keychain call fails.","+","+## What you still need to do (I didn't touch your live system)","+","+- Reload the agent:","+  `launchctl bootout gui/$UID/com.vk.nightly-review; launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist`","+  Then test it with `launchctl kickstart -k gui/$UID/com.vk.nightly-review`.","+  Check that you get a Telegram message and a fresh, non-empty","+  `nightly-review-YYYY-MM-DD.md`.","+- If you still get \"Not logged in\" because the keychain is locked at 02:30, run","+  `claude setup-token`. Store the token in a file only you can read","+  (`chmod 600`), then `export CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` from it in the script.","+  Don't put it in the plist.","+- Security: `README.md` contains a Telegram bot token in plain text, and it is","+  not git-ignored. Remove it and revoke it with @BotFather. Do **not** source","+  `~/.env` (Stripe/AWS/DB secrets) in this job. The agent doesn't need them."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/private/tmp/h-AU38b9/ANSWER.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Pp4kjntfif4sfo5naormdw","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
